<title>USA: Iowa $210 mln school warrants yield 3.80 pct.</title>
<headline>Iowa $210 mln school warrants yield 3.80 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray Inc. said Tuesday it priced $210 million Iowa School District warrant certificates with a 4.50 percent coupon to yield 3.80 percent.</p>
<p>The warrants, which are due on June 26, 1998, are rated MIG-1 by Moody's Investors Service Inc. and SP1-plus by Standard &amp; Poor's Corp.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
